  "id": "chocolate-and-chestnut-christmas-pudding",
  "name": "Chocolate and Chestnut Christmas Pudding",
  "subtitle": "A rich steamed pudding with dried fruit, chocolate, citrus, and chestnuts.",
  "description": "A festive steamed dessert combining cocoa, dark chocolate, spiced dried fruit, stem ginger, and chestnuts, served warm with cream or ice cream.",
